48
00:06:09,884 --> 00:06:13,148
[Host] It means development — creating something new.

49
00:06:13,747 --> 00:06:23,827
[Slow] 税率が同じになると、これからは値段ではなく、味で勝負する競争になります。

50
00:06:24,627 --> 00:06:29,908
[Host] With equal tax rates, companies will now compete on taste, not price.

51
